        "description": {
          "text": "Added efficacy/safety data showing avanafil onset approximately 15 minutes after dosing for erectile dysfunction treatment",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This \u201cPrior Approval\u201d supplemental application provides for revisions to the Prescribing Information with safety and efficacy information from Study TA-501 entitled \u201c*A Randomized, Double-Blind, Placebo-Controlled Evaluation of Avanafil for On-Demand Treatment of Men with Erectile Dysfunction.*\u201d The study was conducted to examine the therapeutic effects of two doses of avanafil (100 mg and 200 mg) approximately 15 minutes after dosing.",
